  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "25. Muster Armies",
    "ruleNumber": "25.03",
    "summary": "Agree a size with your opponent. Each player’s allotment for Incursion is 1,000 army points, 2 Detachment Points, 2 enhancements and 2 copies per datasheet name. Strike Force allows 2,000 army points, 3 Detachment Points, 4 enhancements and 3 copies per datasheet name. Spend Detachment Points to unlock detachments and price units from the official Warhammer app. The per-name cap doubles if a unit is BATTLELINE or has the DEDICATED TRANSPORT keyword. EPIC HERO entries have a cap of one apiece at either size.",
